    "name": "g91_arc_written_absolute",
    "description": "Every firmware's G2/G3 reads X and Y as absolute even under G91 (spec/firmware.md §9), so a relative I/J arc goes out with the absolute X and Y it ends at (start plus offset); its I and J, already offsets, are left as written. G91.1 (incremental arc centres) sets nothing here: its arcs' X and Y stay absolute.",
